+  "conclusion": "not a frontier delay: the deficit grows with depth (lp85 14 -> 348 lost states). The object-class filter is not shippable as a default."
+ },
+ "WHERE_THE_COST_ACTUALLY_IS": {
+  "candidate_generation_share_of_search_time": 0.05,
