+  "the_one_verdict_the_cut_changes": "at the envelope's mine_uncontended_ci_hi level the shipped arm (149.45 s) does NOT fit the 146.33 s residual, and the deployable cut (124.50 s) does. Everywhere else the cut only widens or narrows a margin without flipping it.",
